<%- include('../partials/head', { fullWidth: true }) %>
<%- include('../partials/page_banner', { intro: 'From booking to follow-up, step by step.' }) %>

<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">For Patients</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Your Consultation in Six Steps</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="journey">
      <li>
        <span class="journey-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <h3>Create your account</h3>
        <p>Register with your matric or staff number, date of birth and phone number. If you already have a paper UHS folder, visit the records office instead so your history is linked.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="journey-icon"><i class="fa-regular fa-calendar-check" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <h3>Book a time</h3>
        <p>Choose a video call, audio call or in-person visit, pick a date and a free slot, and tell the doctor briefly why you are coming.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="journey-icon"><i class="fa-regular fa-bell" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <h3>Get reminders</h3>
        <p>You are reminded 24 hours and 1 hour before the appointment, in the app and by email. You can cancel from "Appointments" if your plans change.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="journey-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-video" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <h3>Join the call or check in</h3>
        <p>For a remote appointment, the "Join consultation" button appears 15 minutes before. For an in-person visit, check in at the records office.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="journey-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-doctor" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <h3>See the doctor</h3>
        <p>The doctor sees your record — allergies, vital signs and past visits — and writes the diagnosis, notes and any prescription.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="journey-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-prescription" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <h3>Follow up</h3>
        <p>Your notes and prescription appear in "My record". If the doctor sets a follow-up date you get a reminder, and you can message the doctor with questions.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-gradient">
  <div class="wrap about2 reverse">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Before Your Call</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Get Ready for a Remote Consultation</h2>
      <p>A few minutes of preparation helps the doctor assess you properly.</p>
      <ul class="checks">
        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> Allow your browser to use your camera and microphone (microphone only for audio calls).</li>
        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> Find a quiet, private place with good network signal.</li>
        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> Have the medicines you are taking and recent test results nearby.</li>
        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> If the doctor has not joined yet, please wait — you are in the queue.</li>
        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> Never share the consultation link: the room is private to your appointment.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="single-photo">
      <img src="/static/img/hero.jpg" alt="A doctor on a video call with a patient at home" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">At the Clinic</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Walk-ins and Phone Bookings Still Work</h2>
      <p>Not everyone books online. The records office uses the same system, so every visit ends up in the same record.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mini-grid">
      <div class="mini-card">
        <span><i class="fa-solid fa-person-walking" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <div><h3>Walk in</h3><p>The records office finds or registers you, adds you to today's queue and checks you in.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="mini-card">
        <span><i class="fa-solid fa-phone-volume" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <div><h3>Book by phone</h3><p>Staff book a free slot for you over the phone, exactly like an online booking.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="mini-card">
        <span><i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <div><h3>Vital signs</h3><p>A nurse records your temperature, blood pressure and weight before the doctor sees you.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
